                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote13" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 13"><sup>13</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>Marvin Goodfriend, “The Elusive Promise of Independent Central Banking,” Bank of Japan Monetary and Economic Studies, November 2012, vol. 30, pp. 39-54.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote14" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 14"><sup>14</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>See Jeffrey M. Lacker, “<a href="/press_room/speeches/jeffrey_m_lacker/2013/lacker_speech_20130829">A Look Back at the History of the Federal Reserve</a>,” Speech at Christopher Newport University, Newport News, VA, August 29, 2013.</p></div>
